Provider logos

The SVG files in this folder are unmodified copies of files from the npm
package @lobehub/icons-static-svg, version 1.95.1
(https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons), directory `icons/`:

  openai.svg, claude-color.svg, gemini-color.svg, grok.svg, qwen-color.svg,
  kimi.svg, zai.svg, opencode.svg, ollama.svg, lmstudio.svg

Only these files are vendored; the package is not a dependency.
ProviderLogo renders them as they are: no recoloring and no change to their
proportions. Monochrome files use `currentColor` and follow the text color.

The logos are trademarks of their respective owners (OpenAI, Anthropic,
Google, xAI, Alibaba Cloud, Moonshot AI, Z.ai, OpenCode, Ollama and
LM Studio). Butler uses them only to name the service a person connects to;
no endorsement is implied.

